    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl p-8">
      <p class="text-white font-display uppercase lg:text-6xl text-xl">
        Hello, my name is Daniel!
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl p-8">
      <p class="text-white font-display uppercase lg:text-3xl">
        I am a recent Commputer Science graduate from Virginia Tech with a
        passion for software engineering and AI. My journey has equipped me with
        a diverse skill set, including proficiency in Python, Java, JavaScript,
        HTML/CSS, etc. My previous experiences spans across full-stack web
        development and AI/ML, shaping my approach to creating innovative
        solutions.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
